sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Guest
    participant Web as Discovery & Search (Google / GEO / OTA)
    participant Booking as Booking Engine (SynXis / iHotelier)
    participant PMS as Property PMS (OPERA / OnQ)
    participant POS as F&B POS (Micros Simphony)
    participant WiFi as Wi-Fi Portal (ElevenOS)
    participant CRM as CRM (Revinate)

    rect rgb(15, 23, 42)
    Note over Guest,Web: STAGE 1: SEARCH & DISCOVERY
    Guest->>Web: Searches luxury hotel SOMA SF (Google / AI Engine)
    Web-->>Guest: Displays Vanity Site + Google Hotel Center rates
    end

    rect rgb(30, 27, 75)
    Note over Guest,Booking: STAGE 2: SHOPPING & BOOKING
    alt Direct Vanity Booking (High Margin)
        Guest->>Booking: Selects room & enters payment
        Booking->>Booking: GTM fires purchase event to GA4
        Booking->>PMS: Tokens & reservation injected into PMS
    else OTA Booking (Expedia - Margin Loss)
        Guest->>Web: Books on Expedia (15-25pct commission)
        Web->>PMS: Pushes reservation with MASKED email
    end
    end

    rect rgb(6, 78, 59)
    Note over PMS,CRM: STAGE 3: PRE-ARRIVAL UPSELLS
    PMS->>CRM: Pushes reservation roster (3-5 days prior)
    CRM->>Guest: Automated email: Room upgrade, parking, check-in
    end

    rect rgb(67, 20, 7)
    Note over Guest,POS: STAGE 4: ON-PROPERTY CONSUMPTION
    Guest->>PMS: Front Desk Check-in (Status: IN HOUSE)
    Guest->>WiFi: Connects to Guest Wi-Fi Captive Portal
    WiFi->>CRM: CAPTURES REAL GUEST EMAIL (Reclaims OTA identity)
    Guest->>POS: Orders dinner/drinks at hotel restaurant
    POS->>PMS: Is Room 402 valid? -> Posts charge to folio
    end

    rect rgb(19, 78, 74)
    Note over PMS,CRM: STAGE 5: NIGHT AUDIT & RETENTION
    PMS->>PMS: Night Audit closes folios (Calculates ADR / RevPAR)
    PMS->>CRM: Guest status: CHECKED OUT
    CRM->>Guest: Automated post-stay NPS survey & direct re-booking offer
    end
